# Floppy has two apps, each with its own env file:
#
#   apps/api/.env        ← copy from apps/api/.env.example
#                          (database URL, Clerk secret + webhook secret,
#                           Novu secret key + application identifier,
#                           GitHub token, AI key, demo password)
#
#   apps/web/.env.local  ← copy from apps/web/.env.example
#                          (API URL, Clerk publishable + secret key,
#                           Novu application identifier)
#
# Email (Resend) and SMS (Twilio) provider keys are NOT stored in this repo or
# its env files: you paste them into Novu → Integrations, and Novu sends
# through them. See README.md → "Notifications".
#
# Never commit real values. .gitignore already excludes .env and .env.local.
